# Subject line: aim for ~50 characters
#         1         2         3         4         5
#12345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890
#                                                 ^ 50
<type>(<scope>): <short summary>

# Body lines: maximum 72 characters
#         1         2         3         4         5         6         7
#123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012
#                                                                       ^ 72

Why:
- <Why was this change necessary?>

Changes:
- <Describe the first important change.>
- <Describe the second important change.>
- <Describe the third important change.>

Assets:
- <Content/...>
- <Source/...>
- <Config/...>

Testing:
- Editor: <tested / not tested>
- PIE: <tested / not tested>
- Standalone: <tested / not tested>
- Packaged build: <tested / not tested>

Notes:
- <Known issues, dependencies, migrations, or follow-up work.>


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Commit types
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# feat       New gameplay, system, or content feature
# fix        Bug fix
# asset      New or modified Unreal asset
# level      Map or level changes
# blueprint  Blueprint-specific changes
# code       C++ changes
# material   Materials or shader changes
# ui         UMG or UI changes
# audio      Sound or music changes
# anim       Animation changes
# config     .ini, project, plugin, or configuration changes
# build      UnrealBuildTool, targets, modules, or toolchain changes
# perf       Performance improvements
# refactor   Restructuring without intended behavior changes
# test       Tests or test maps
# docs       Documentation
# chore      Maintenance or cleanup
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Examples
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# feat(colosseum): add modular outer wall
#
# fix(door): correct interaction collision
#
# blueprint(jumppad): fix launch behavior
#
# asset(seating): revise lower-bowl seating
#
# level(arena): update entrance layout
#
# build(ue5): update Unreal Build Tool settings
#
# config(vs): fix Visual Studio integration
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rules
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# 1. Keep the subject line around 50 characters when practical.
# 2. Use the imperative mood:
#       "add seating system"
#    not:
#       "added seating system"
# 3. Do not end the subject line with a period.
# 4. Leave one blank line between the subject and body.
# 5. Wrap body text at no more than 72 characters per line.
# 6. Explain WHY the change was made, not only WHAT changed.
# 7. Identify important .uasset, .umap, C++, and config changes.
# 8. Record how the change was tested.
